    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1143">

                <pb facs="0855" n="779" sameAs="frus:frus1916/pg779"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 312.115/253</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Vice Consul Blocker to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegrams]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Consulate</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Eagle Pass</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1916-06-20T10:00:00-06:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">June 20, 1916, 10 a.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Governor State of Coahuila yesterday ordered all military commanders in
                    neighborhood of American ranches within a radius of <pb facs="0856" n="780"
                        xml:id="pg780"/> one hundred miles of the border to immediately begin
                    gathering of all horses and cattle thereon and to collect them into moderate
                    size herds, driving them southward toward Saitillo. Approximately three million
                    dollars worth American property is involved. Vice Consul is informed soldiers
                    have been dispatched to begin rounding up to-day. American owners have been
                    informed by military authorities that order from governor is imperative. Suggest
                    Department act immediately before cattle are taken from their ranches.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Blocker</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
